---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { settings } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="How we work and onboard your support"
  description="From first inquiry to written scope and onboarding: understand VSS task ownership, account access, updates, and working arrangements."
  ><section class="vss-page-hero vss-container">
    <p class="vss-pill">
      <span class="vss-dot"></span><span data-site-content="approachEyebrow"
        >{settings.approachEyebrow}</span>
    </p><h1>
      <span data-site-content="approachHeadline">{settings.approachHeadline}</span><br /><em
        data-site-content="approachEmphasis">{settings.approachEmphasis}</em>
    </h1><p data-site-content="approachLead">{settings.approachLead}</p>
  </section><section class="vss-container vss-section vss-approach">
    <article>
      <span class="vss-step-number">01</span><div>
        <p class="vss-eyebrow">UNDERSTAND THE WORK</p><h2>Start with your everyday.</h2><p>
          Describe the recurring tasks, tools, deadlines, and decisions that take up your time. We
          discuss volume, priorities, and what a useful handoff looks like.
        </p><ul>
          <li>Which tasks are recurring?</li><li>What needs your decision?</li><li>
            Which tools and time zones are involved?
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article><article>
      <span class="vss-step-number">02</span><div>
        <p class="vss-eyebrow">AGREE BEFORE ONBOARDING</p><h2>Put the arrangement in writing.</h2><p
        >
          We confirm responsibilities, hours, fees, availability, reporting, and any additional
          charges before work begins. Sending an inquiry creates no payment obligation.
        </p><ul>
          <li>Written scope and expected outputs</li><li>
            Working hours and response expectations
          </li><li>Tools, access, confidentiality, and escalation</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article><article>
      <span class="vss-step-number">03</span><div>
        <p class="vss-eyebrow">BUILD A WORKING RHYTHM</p><h2>Keep the next step clear.</h2><p>
          Onboard the agreed support, share instructions through approved channels, and review
          progress. Changes to scope or commitments are discussed before being taken on.
        </p><a class="vss-button vss-button-blue" href="/contact/"
          >Start the conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section></BaseLayout
>
